425
00:49:12,872 --> 00:49:19,472
この迷いの中で ただ意味を求め 許されてゆくはずでしょ
Seeking just meaning within this hesitation, we should be forgiven.

426
00:49:21,072 --> 00:49:26,172
ヒラヒラヒラ ヒラヒラヒラ 落ちるように
Fluttering down like falling petals...

427
00:49:29,872 --> 00:49:34,572
苦しいこと 悲しいこと すべて抱いて生きてきた
Painful things, sad things—I've lived embracing it all.

428
00:49:37,372 --> 00:49:44,572
僕が あなたが 生まれた日から 心に刻む男
From the day I was born, the day you were born, carving into our hearts...

429
00:49:44,572 --> 00:49:50,072
何を裏切られて 感じ続けて 心壊されてゆく
Being betrayed by what, continuing to feel, our hearts are breaking.

430
00:49:52,072 --> 00:49:59,072
今僕らは叫んで 叫んで 触れて この目に映るほど
Right now, we are shouting, shouting, touching, until it reflects in these eyes.

431
00:50:00,493 --> 00:50:03,353
風に吹かれて 誰も気づかぬように
Blown by the wind so that no one notices

432
00:50:03,733 --> 00:50:06,013
区別がつかない
Can't distinguish

433
00:50:06,013 --> 00:50:10,053
モノクロの世界
a monochrome world.

434
00:50:34,266 --> 00:50:37,826
すべて抱いて生きてきた
Embracing everything I've lived through,

435
00:50:37,926 --> 00:50:43,426
僕が あなたが 私が 君が 心に刻むんだ
I, you, I, you, carving it into our hearts.

436
00:50:44,280 --> 00:50:47,460
何を信じ続けて
What should I keep believing in,

437
00:50:47,460 --> 00:50:50,080
感じ続けて
keep feeling,

438
00:50:50,080 --> 00:50:53,380
ここに立ち焦がれてる
standing here yearning for?

439
00:50:53,880 --> 00:50:56,580
今 僕らは
Right now, we are

440
00:50:56,580 --> 00:51:00,280
叫んで 叫んで 触れて
shouting, shouting, touching,

441
00:51:00,280 --> 00:51:03,430
この手が滲むほど
until these hands blur—

442
00:51:03,430 --> 00:51:06,430
いつだって聞こえた
I could always hear it,

443
00:51:06,430 --> 00:51:10,580
すくう心の砕かれぬように
protecting my fragile heart from breaking.

444
00:52:00,320 --> 00:52:02,900
風に吹かれて
Blown by the wind,

445
00:52:02,900 --> 00:52:05,940
誰も気づかぬように
so that no one notices,

446
00:52:06,080 --> 00:52:08,620
区別がつかない
indistinguishable

447
00:52:08,800 --> 00:52:11,460
モノクロの世界
in a monochrome world.

448
00:52:12,260 --> 00:52:14,700
色を足しても
Even when adding colors,

449
00:52:15,000 --> 00:52:17,460
何も見えなくて
I couldn't see anything at all,

450
00:52:17,900 --> 00:52:22,860
まるで私は 息を止めていた
as if I had been holding my breath.

451
00:52:27,960 --> 00:52:30,480
もういいよ
It's fine now,

452
00:52:30,480 --> 00:52:34,700
遠くても 叶えたい 私は
even if it's far, I want to make it happen.

453
00:52:35,080 --> 00:52:40,480
こんな世界 想いも抱きしめていたいのに
In this world, I want to hold my feelings close,

454
00:52:40,880 --> 00:52:46,680
夢のキャンバスに 居続ける意味はこの胸に 輝いているストーリー
the meaning of lingering on dreams shines bright—a story.

455
00:52:47,100 --> 00:52:49,880
与えることに意味などないけど
There's no real meaning in giving,

456
00:52:49,880 --> 00:52:52,560
拾い集めたカケラ失うの?
am I losing the fragments I gathered?

457
00:52:52,560 --> 00:52:56,280
そして夜はその冷たさを
And at night, I reached out my hand

458
00:52:56,280 --> 00:52:59,080
溶かして手を伸ばした
to melt away that coldness.

459
00:53:04,480 --> 00:53:07,040
抱え込むここに
Holding onto this place,

460
00:53:07,440 --> 00:53:10,100
意味などないけど
even if it has no meaning,

461
00:53:10,300 --> 00:53:12,900
昨日は冷えた
yesterday was cold,

462
00:53:13,300 --> 00:53:16,060
心失うの
will I lose my heart?

463
00:53:16,260 --> 00:53:20,380
そして夜はその冷たさを
And at night, I reached out my hand

464
00:53:20,380 --> 00:53:26,580
どうかして手を伸ばした もういいよ
somehow to melt away that coldness... It's fine now,

465
00:53:28,080 --> 00:53:30,480
遠くても 叶えたい
even if it's far, I want to make it happen.

466
00:53:31,060 --> 00:53:35,460
私は 受け止めていく 涙も
I will accept even the tears,

467
00:53:35,860 --> 00:53:40,280
抱きしめていたいのに 夢のキャンバスに
even though I want to hold them close on the canvas.

468
00:53:40,580 --> 00:53:45,380
ここに込めるのは この空に 描き出すストーリー
What I put into my heart here is a story drawn across the sky.

469
00:54:03,280 --> 00:54:05,860
そして夜は
And at night,

470
00:54:05,860 --> 00:54:09,680
その冷たさを どうかして
somehow softening that coldness,

471
00:54:09,680 --> 00:54:13,460
手を伸ばした もういいよ
I reached out my hand... It's fine now,

472
00:54:13,960 --> 00:54:17,460
遠くても 叶えたい
even if it's far, I want to make it happen.

473
00:54:18,060 --> 00:54:22,460
私の 声なき世界 想いを
In my voiceless world, wrapping my feelings

474
00:54:22,460 --> 00:54:26,460
言葉で包んだ 夢のキャンバスに
in words on the canvas of dreams,

475
00:54:26,860 --> 00:54:31,080
色を足してゆく この胸に
adding colors into this heart

476
00:54:31,460 --> 00:54:38,280
今 輝いて 強くなくてもいい 壊れかけてもいい
shining now. It's okay not to be strong, to break.

477
00:54:44,280 --> 00:54:49,880
この心は永久(とわ)に羽ばたいて 響くように
This heart will forever soar, resonating

478
00:54:49,880 --> 00:54:55,380
塗り替えてゆく パレット
and repainting the palette.

479
00:55:30,788 --> 00:55:31,388
みんな
Everyone,

480
00:55:31,508 --> 00:55:32,138
サンキュー！
thank you!

481
00:55:32,278 --> 00:55:33,448
大好きだよ！
I love you!

482
00:55:33,708 --> 00:55:35,328
ありがとー！
Thank you!

483
00:55:48,588 --> 00:56:07,048
常闇トワ 1周年記念 BAND LIVE
